          "officialDisplayName": "Multishot",
          "officialDescription": "CHANNELED - Drow releases a flurry of arrows in continuous salvos, hitting enemies for extra damage and applying Frost Arrows. Lasts up to %abilitychanneltime% seconds.<br><br>Drow can move slowly and use items while casting Multishot.",
