          "internalAbilityName": "drow_ranger_glacier",
          "officialDisplayName": "Glacier",
          "officialDescription": "Drow creates a hill of ice beneath her, knocking away nearby enemies. Units on the hill gain flying vision and Drow and her ranged allies gain bonus attack range. Drow gains additional damage while on the Glacier and attacking targets below her.<br><br>The front of the hill obscures vision and cannot be moved through except by Drow. Does not interrupt Multishot when cast.",
