          "internalAbilityName": "juggernaut_omni_slash",
          "officialDisplayName": "Omnislash",
          "officialDescription": "Juggernaut leaps towards the target enemy units, and then slashes the target and other nearby enemy units at an increased attack rate. Juggernaut is invulnerable for the duration.\n\nDISPEL TYPE: Basic Dispel",
