          "internalAbilityName": "juggernaut_bladeform",
          "officialDisplayName": "Bladeform",
          "officialDescription": "Juggernaut gains a stack of Bladeform every %stack_gain_time%s that Juggernaut does not take damage. Each stack grants bonus base Agility and Movement Speed. Stacks fade after %linger_duration%s upon taking any damage.",
