          "internalAbilityName": "nevermore_shadowraze1",
          "officialDisplayName": "Shadowraze",
          "officialDescription": "Shadow Fiend razes the ground directly in front of him, dealing damage to enemy units in the area, dealing bonus damage based on his current Necromastery Soul amount. Adds a stacking damage amplifier on the target that causes the enemy to take bonus Shadowraze damage per stack.",
