          "officialDisplayName": "Phantom Rush",
          "officialDescription": "When targeting an enemy for an attack, Phantom Lancer quickly charges into range, gaining increased movement speed and evasion.",
          "notes": [
            "If the attack order is cancelled, the movement speed bonus is lost.",
            "Rush movement speed is %bonus_speed%."
          ]
