          "internalAbilityName": "tidehunter_dead_in_the_water",
          "officialDisplayName": "Dead in the Water",
          "officialDescription": "Tidehunter attaches a heavy anchor to an enemy hero. The hero is leashed while attached to the anchor. Attempting to move more than %chain_length% units away from the anchor forces the hero to %max_movement_speed% move speed, dragging the anchor behind them. The anchor can be destroyed with %attacks_to_destroy% hero attacks.",
