          "internalAbilityName": "tinker_deploy_turrets",
          "officialDisplayName": "Deploy Turrets",
          "officialDescription": "Deploys <b>3</b> uncontrollable turrets at the target location. Enemies hit by the impact take damage and are pushed away from the landing point. If Tinker is hit, he also gets pushed by the impact. Once deployed, the turret fires missiles in the direction of the nearest enemy hero.",
