          "internalAbilityName": "sniper_assassinate",
          "officialDisplayName": "Assassinate",
          "officialDescription": "Sniper locks onto a target enemy unit and, after a short aiming duration, fires a devastating shot that deals Sniper's attack damage plus bonus damage at long range and mini-stuns the target. Whenever Sniper kills an enemy hero, Assassinate is refreshed.",
