        "sourceMetadata": {
          "internalAbilityName": "abaddon_aphotic_shield",
          "officialDisplayName": "Aphotic Shield",
          "officialDescription": "Summons dark energies around an ally unit, dispelling them and creating an all damage barrier that absorbs a set amount of damage before expiring. When the barrier is destroyed it will burst and deal damage equal to the amount it could absorb to an area around it.\n\nDISPEL TYPE: Strong Dispel",
          "notes": [
            "The max damage is always dealt whether the barrier is destroyed by expiring or absorbing damage.",
            "The explosion does not damage units hidden by the fog of war."
          ]
        }
