          "internalAbilityName": "huskar_berserkers_blood",
          "officialDisplayName": "Berserker's Blood",
          "officialDescription": "Huskar's injuries feed his power, giving increased attack speed, magic resistance and health regen based on missing health. Health regen is a percentage of your strength.",
