          "internalAbilityName": "weaver_time_lapse",
          "officialDisplayName": "Time Lapse",
          "officialDescription": "Weaver warps backward to whatever position it was in five seconds earlier--regaining the HP and mana from that time. No effect on cooldown, gold or experience.\n\nDISPEL TYPE: Strong Dispel",
