          "internalAbilityName": "weaver_threads_of_fate",
          "officialDisplayName": "Threads of Fate",
          "officialDescription": "Whenever Weaver deals damage to an enemy hero with an attack or ability, if he remains within %thread_setup_distance% range of them for %thread_setup_time%s, he establishes a Thread of Fate that briefly slows the enemy and ties Weaver and the enemy together. Each established thread of fate grants bonus damage to Weaver.",
