          "internalAbilityName": "brewmaster_liquid_courage",
          "officialDisplayName": "Liquid Courage",
          "officialDescription": "When Brewmaster drops below %min_health_threshold%%% Health he gains a Status Resistance buff and his movement speed alternates every %speed_toggle_time%s between being faster and being slower. The effect becomes stronger at lower health, scaling from 0 up to max values at %max_health_threshold%%% Health.",
