          "scepterText": "Gains a passive component.  When an illusion of Chaos Knight is created, there is a %bonus_illusion_chance%%% chance to create an additional illusion under Chaos Knight's control.<br><br>When Phantasm is activated, also creates an illusion of allied heroes globally.",
