          "internalAbilityName": "disruptor_glimpse",
          "officialDisplayName": "Glimpse",
          "officialDescription": "Teleports the target hero back to where it was %backtrack_time% seconds ago.  Instantly kills illusions. Deals damage equal to a percentage of the distance glimpsed, that cannot go over a damage maximum.",
