          "internalAbilityName": "medusa_split_shot",
          "officialDisplayName": "Split Shot",
          "officialDescription": "Medusa magically splits her shot into several arrows. These arrows deal a lower percent of her normal damage.<br/><br/>The extra targets will not receive other attack effects (such as critical strike).",
