          "internalAbilityName": "medusa_mana_shield",
          "officialDisplayName": "Mana Shield",
          "officialDescription": "Creates a shield that absorbs %absorption_pct%%% of incoming damage in exchange for Medusa's mana. Illusions absorb %illusion_percentage%%% less damage per point of mana.",
