          "internalAbilityName": "tusk_drinking_buddies",
          "officialDisplayName": "Drinking Buddies",
          "officialDescription": "Tusk reaches out to tag an allied unit, pulling them closer. Once tagged, both Tusk and his tagged ally gain movement speed and armor.",
