          "internalAbilityName": "elder_titan_natural_order",
          "officialDisplayName": "Natural Order",
          "officialDescription": "Reduces all elements to their basic levels, removing base armor and magic damage resistance from nearby enemy units. The armor reduction is centered around the hero, while the magic armor reduction is centered around Astral Spirit.",
