          "officialDescription": "Earth Spirit pulls the target Stone Remnant or Allied Unit. Enemies struck by the gripped target will be silenced.<br><br>Pulled Remnants also deal damage to struck enemies.<br><br>Cast range is reduced when targeting an ally.",
