          "internalAbilityName": "phoenix_icarus_dive",
          "officialDisplayName": "Icarus Dive",
          "officialDescription": "Phoenix dives forward in an arc with a fixed distance in the targeted direction, dealing damage over time and slowing the movement speed of any units it comes into contact with, and then orbiting back to its original position. If Phoenix casts Supernova, the dive ends.",
