          "officialDisplayName": "Spark Wraith",
          "officialDescription": "Summons a Spark Wraith that slowly materializes and patrols a targeted area until an enemy comes within its range. Once a target has been found the wraith fuses with them, dealing magical damage and slowing the unit.",
