          "internalAbilityName": "dark_willow_bramble_maze",
          "officialDisplayName": "Bramble Maze",
          "officialDescription": "Dark Willow creates a %placement_range% AoE maze of %placement_count% brambles that grow in the target area after %initial_creation_delay% seconds. Enemies that walk into a bramble are rooted and take damage over time. Lasts %placement_duration% seconds.",
