        "sourceMetadata": {
          "internalAbilityName": "primal_beast_onslaught",
          "officialDisplayName": "Onslaught",
          "officialDescription": "Primal Beast charges up and then runs in the chosen direction, knocking back enemies and allies alike. Enemy units are damaged and stunned on impact. The longer the charge duration, the farther Primal Beast's momentum will carry him. \n\n Can be cancelled at any time with the Stop command.",
          "notes": []
        }
