          "internalAbilityName": "muerta_spectral_slug",
          "officialDisplayName": "Spectral Slug",
          "officialDescription": "Muerta shoots a spectral bullet at an enemy, dealing damage, knocking them back, and turning them ethereal for %duration%s - rendering them immune to physical damage and unable to attack. The target is slowed and %bonus_spell_damage_pct%%% more vulnerable to magic damage. Enemies will not be knocked out of Muerta's attack range.",
