          "officialDisplayName": "Funhouse Mirror",
          "officialDescription": "<h1>Use: Proportion Distortion</h1>Creates %images_count% imperfect image of your hero that lasts %illusion_duration% seconds. Your illusion deals %tooltip_damage_outgoing_ranged%%% and takes  %tooltip_damage_incoming_total_pct%%% damage.",
