          "internalAbilityName": "vengefulspirit_nether_swap",
          "officialDisplayName": "Nether Swap",
          "officialDescription": "Instantaneously swaps positions with a target Hero, friend or enemy. Nether Swap interrupts channeling abilities on the target. Enemy Swapped units take damage. Vengeful Spirit and allied swapped units gain a barrier equal to the damage dealt.",
